  click ao_asthma href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ao_asthma" "Chronic inflammatory disease of the airways." _blank
  click ao_fibrosis href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ao_fibrosis" "Scarring of lung tissue by excess connective tissue." _blank
  click assess_biomonitoring href "https://example.org/exposome-map/assess_biomonitoring" "Measurement of chemicals or their markers in human body fluids and tissues. Its matrices are marked as a gap on the board." _blank
  click assess_external_exposome href "https://example.org/exposome-map/assess_external_exposome" "Measurement of exposure outside the body." _blank
  click assess_internal_exposome href "https://example.org/exposome-map/assess_internal_exposome" "Measurement of exposure and its effects inside the body." _blank
  click chem_6ppd href "https://example.org/exposome-map/chem_6ppd" "Tire rubber additive that protects the rubber against ozone and oxidation." _blank
  click chem_6ppd_quinone href "https://example.org/exposome-map/chem_6ppd_quinone" "Transformation product of 6PPD formed by reaction with ozone." _blank
  click chem_alpha_pinene href "https://example.org/exposome-map/chem_alpha_pinene" "Monoterpene emitted by vegetation, mainly conifers." _blank
  click chem_hydroxyl_radical href "https://example.org/exposome-map/chem_hydroxyl_radical" "Atmospheric oxidant (hydroxyl radical)." _blank
  click chem_ozone href "https://example.org/exposome-map/chem_ozone" "Atmospheric oxidant (O3)." _blank
  click emission_non_exhaust href "https://example.org/exposome-map/emission_non_exhaust" "Traffic emissions that do not come from the exhaust, such as tire, brake and road wear." _blank
  click emission_tire_road_wear href "https://example.org/exposome-map/emission_tire_road_wear" "Material released by abrasion between tire and road." _blank
  click ke_allergic_response href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_allergic_response" "Immune reaction of the airways to an inhaled allergen." _blank
  click ke_catalase href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_catalase" "Antioxidant enzyme that breaks down hydrogen peroxide; its level reflects the response to reactive oxygen species." _blank
  click ke_emt href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_emt" "Epithelial cells lose their epithelial character and take on a mesenchymal one. Listed under 'outcome' on the board; modelled here as a key event on the way to fibrosis." _blank
  click ke_eosinophils href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_eosinophils" "Recruitment of eosinophils to the airways." _blank
  click ke_erk_dependent href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_erk_dependent" "Signalling that runs through the extracellular signal-regulated kinase (ERK)." _blank
  click ke_erk_independent href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_erk_independent" "Signalling that does not run through the extracellular signal-regulated kinase (ERK)." _blank
  click ke_inflammation href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_inflammation" "Inflammatory response of the lung tissue." _blank
  click ke_macrophages href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_macrophages" "Activation and recruitment of macrophages in the lung." _blank
  click ke_nfkb href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_nfkb" "Activation of the transcription factor NF-kappaB, a central switch of inflammatory gene expression." _blank
  click ke_ros_pathway href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_ros_pathway" "Formation of reactive oxygen species and the cellular response to them." _blank
  click ke_signalling_pathways href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_signalling_pathways" "Intracellular signalling cascades that pass the stress signal on to gene expression and cell behaviour." _blank
  click ke_unjamming_transition href "https://example.org/exposome-map/ke_unjamming_transition" "The airway epithelium changes from a solid-like, jammed layer to a fluid-like, migratory one. Listed under 'outcome' on the board." _blank
